142,imgsize-173452.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian students in Canada denied of post-graduation work permit start hunger strike: 'We studied here, we deserve to work here']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132613776.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-students-in-canada-denied-of-post-graduation-work-permit-start-hunger-strike-we-studied-here-we-deserve-to-work-here/articleshow/132613776.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-students-in-canada-denied-of-post-graduation-work-permit-start-hunger-strike-we-studied-here-we-deserve-to-work-here/articleshow/132613776.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T00:29:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132613865,imgsize-51038.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[YouTuber Joe Is Hungry says he never expected his KFC Popcorn Chicken review to go viral]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132613746.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Food reviewer Joe Is Hungry expressed surprise at his KFC Popcorn Chicken video's popularity.  The video garnered nearly twenty million views across various social media platforms.  Joe admitted he did not anticipate such widespread attention for the review.  He also discussed the challenges involved in creating his unique food review videos.  His distinctive filming style and honest reactions continue to attract a large audience.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/youtuber-joe-is-hungry-says-he-never-expected-his-kfc-popcorn-chicken-review-to-go-viral/articleshow/132613746.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/youtuber-joe-is-hungry-says-he-never-expected-his-kfc-popcorn-chicken-review-to-go-viral/articleshow/132613746.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T00:21:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132613711,imgsize-831675.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-American doctor speaks out after viral video sparks 'go back to India' abuse over bindi]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132612069.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-american-doctor-speaks-out-after-viral-video-sparks-go-back-to-india-abuse-over-bindi/articleshow/132612069.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-american-doctor-speaks-out-after-viral-video-sparks-go-back-to-india-abuse-over-bindi/articleshow/132612069.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T23:33:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132612213,imgsize-938754.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In the 1980s, Scotland planted commercial trees across parts of a 9,000-year-old peatland]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132610986.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The ancient peatlands of Scotland are undergoing a significant restoration, which addresses the detrimental effects caused by tree planting. Conservationists are diligently working to eliminate commercial trees, aiming to enhance wildlife habitats and maintain stored carbon levels. This notable effort is primarily focused on the Flow Country, a treasure trove of wetlands recognized as a World Heritage Site for its global ecological importance.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/in-the-1980s-scotland-planted-commercial-trees-across-parts-of-a-9000-year-old-peatland-decades-later-conservationists-are-removing-them-to-protect-wildlife-and-keep-its-stored-carbon-in-the-ground/articleshow/132610986.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/in-the-1980s-scotland-planted-commercial-trees-across-parts-of-a-9000-year-old-peatland-decades-later-conservationists-are-removing-them-to-protect-wildlife-and-keep-its-stored-carbon-in-the-ground/articleshow/132610986.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T23:05:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132611199,imgsize-93558.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Big Bear bald eagle Jackie's health update: Lead poisoning ruled out, bright and strong but critical after life-saving blood transfusion]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132611149.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/big-bear-bald-eagle-jackies-health-update-lead-poisoning-ruled-out-bright-and-strong-but-critical-after-life-saving-blood-transfusion/articleshow/132611149.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/big-bear-bald-eagle-jackies-health-update-lead-poisoning-ruled-out-bright-and-strong-but-critical-after-life-saving-blood-transfusion/articleshow/132611149.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T22:54:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132611231,imgsize-63168.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Florida's first underwater habitat in 40 years will soon host scientists]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132596443.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A new underwater habitat has been installed off the Florida Keys coast. This habitat will allow scientists to live and work beneath the ocean for extended periods.  It offers a unique opportunity to study human health responses to extreme environments.  Research will also focus on coral reef restoration and climate impact assessments.  This marks a significant advancement for marine science and human physiology research.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-gets-its-first-underwater-research-habitat-in-around-40-years-where-scientists-will-soon-live-beneath-the-ocean/articleshow/132596443.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-gets-its-first-underwater-research-habitat-in-around-40-years-where-scientists-will-soon-live-beneath-the-ocean/articleshow/132596443.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T11:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132596465,imgsize-148625.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rare 2,000-year-old Liubo boards found, but the game's rules remain a mystery]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132601571.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ancient Liubo boards discovered in Han Dynasty tombs shed light on a beloved game that transcended social classes for centuries. Archaeologists have detailed the game's equipment and venues of play, yet the precise rules of Liubo continue to elude scholars, presenting an enduring enigma in the realm of archaeology. The allure of this lost gameplay continues to inspire curiosity.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/archaeologists-uncover-rare-2000-year-old-liubo-game-boards-in-han-dynasty-tombs-but-its-rules-remain-one-of-historys-greatest-mysteries/articleshow/132601571.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/archaeologists-uncover-rare-2000-year-old-liubo-game-boards-in-han-dynasty-tombs-but-its-rules-remain-one-of-historys-greatest-mysteries/articleshow/132601571.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T15:15:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132601638,imgsize-1687567.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[This 90-year-old woman in China unknowingly kept using a live grenade as a kitchen hammer for over 20 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132602044.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/this-90-year-old-woman-in-china-unknowingly-kept-using-a-live-grenade-as-a-kitchen-hammer-for-over-20-years/articleshow/132602044.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/this-90-year-old-woman-in-china-unknowingly-kept-using-a-live-grenade-as-a-kitchen-hammer-for-over-20-years/articleshow/132602044.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T15:39:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132602110,imgsize-1131928.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A giant stone jar in Laos holding 37 skeletons may finally solve a century-old mystery]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132603153.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-giant-stone-jar-in-laos-holding-37-skeletons-may-finally-solve-a-century-old-mystery/articleshow/132603153.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-giant-stone-jar-in-laos-holding-37-skeletons-may-finally-solve-a-century-old-mystery/articleshow/132603153.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T21:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132603153,imgsize-2987528.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Diego Garcia became one of the world's most strategic military bases]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132604273.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/diego-garcia-became-one-of-the-worlds-most-strategic-military-bases-after-its-entire-population-was-removed-from-the-island/articleshow/132604273.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/diego-garcia-became-one-of-the-worlds-most-strategic-military-bases-after-its-entire-population-was-removed-from-the-island/articleshow/132604273.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T23:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132604273,imgsize-2156978.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Retired police officer discovers an exceptionally rare white rattlesnake in Arizona, “once-in-a-lifetime” find]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132606883.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/retired-police-officer-discovers-an-exceptionally-rare-white-rattlesnake-in-arizona-once-in-a-lifetime-find/articleshow/132606883.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/retired-police-officer-discovers-an-exceptionally-rare-white-rattlesnake-in-arizona-once-in-a-lifetime-find/articleshow/132606883.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T18:50:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132606980,imgsize-1522501.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[1,600-year-old Roman guardian spirit found beneath ancient fort in northern England]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132607177.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[At Vindolanda fort, archaeologists have made an exciting discovery: a sandstone carving of a Roman guardian spirit, estimated to be 1,600 years old. This striking relief depicts a genius, symbolising the protective spirit revered by the soldiers. Such archaeological finds deepen our understanding of the spiritual lives and beliefs of Roman forces stationed at this military stronghold, adding to the fort's historical narrative.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/1600-year-old-roman-guardian-spirit-discovered-beneath-ancient-fort-in-northern-england-reveals-how-soldiers-sought-divine-protection/articleshow/132607177.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/1600-year-old-roman-guardian-spirit-discovered-beneath-ancient-fort-in-northern-england-reveals-how-soldiers-sought-divine-protection/articleshow/132607177.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T19:15:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132607241,imgsize-1325666.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Seattle's 'Emerald City' from space: How glaciers and people shaped its landscape]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132607410.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ancient glaciers sculpted Seattle's hills and valleys thousands of years ago. Humans later reshaped this terrain through extensive engineering projects. The city's development is closely tied to its numerous waterways and coastlines. These natural and man-made features create the distinctive "Emerald City" landscape. Nasa's image reveals this combined geological and engineering history.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/seattles-emerald-city-from-space-how-glaciers-and-people-shaped-its-landscape/articleshow/132607410.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/seattles-emerald-city-from-space-how-glaciers-and-people-shaped-its-landscape/articleshow/132607410.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T19:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132607481,imgsize-1517114.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scientists discover a 17-million-year-old ape fossil in Egypt that could rewrite early ape evolution]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132609819.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A new fossil ape named Masripithecus was found in northern Egypt. This discovery suggests northeastern Africa played a larger role in early ape evolution. Previously, East Africa was considered the primary region for ape diversification. The Masripithecus fossil fills a geographical and evolutionary gap in scientific understanding. This find expands the map of early hominoid origins beyond East Africa.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/scientists-discover-a-17-million-year-old-ape-fossil-in-egypt-that-could-rewrite-early-ape-evolution/articleshow/132609819.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/scientists-discover-a-17-million-year-old-ape-fossil-in-egypt-that-could-rewrite-early-ape-evolution/articleshow/132609819.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T21:34:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132609912,imgsize-155417.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[8 people entered a sealed glass world believing they could survive for two years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132605750.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/8-people-entered-a-sealed-glass-world-believing-they-could-survive-for-two-years-then-the-oxygen-began-to-disappear/articleshow/132605750.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/8-people-entered-a-sealed-glass-world-believing-they-could-survive-for-two-years-then-the-oxygen-began-to-disappear/articleshow/132605750.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T22:18:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132605750,imgsize-2595459.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Prince William’s Duchy of Cornwall is helping double one of the last surviving temperate rainforests]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/